{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"ed4b6c017c81c77a6deb638aaaf27fb915aaaae2b63566c35103ad72f8ed08e3","slug":"sobre-el-autor","location":"/sobre el autor.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"Profesor: M.Sc. Jesús Zamora Thowinsson","content_includes_title":false,"authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Jesús D. Zamora T.","given":"Jesús D. Zamora","family":"T."},"name":"Jesús D. Zamora T.","email":"info.thowinsson@gmail.com","id":"contributors-myst-generated-uid-0","corresponding":true}],"keywords":["machine learning","data analysis","python","artificial intelligence"],"thumbnail":"/zamora1-d5d4ed83e73a7bb04f73f542855dbd16.png","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"sobre el autor.md","url":"/sobre el autor-dbaadc1b4ba2e84fe595a15631aa3a10.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"container","kind":"figure","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/zamora1-d5d4ed83e73a7bb04f73f542855dbd16.png","alt":"Zamora Thowinsson","width":"320px","align":"center","key":"twbZ2Le5NA","urlSource":"images/zamora1.png"},{"type":"caption","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Zamora Thowinsson","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"key":"H9TuIajDxn"}],"key":"FzKsadF4m7"}],"key":"Ns2KFLScp5"}],"enumerator":"1","key":"ERGrc1CnGD"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Jesús David Zamora Thowinsson es economista y administrador público, especialista y Magíster en Estadística Aplicada (M.Sc.), y actualmente complementa su formación profesional con estudios en Ingeniería de Software.","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"uK0WbwpqjR"}],"key":"zllK9FQ3ZA"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Su trayectoria académica y profesional se ha desarrollado alrededor del análisis cuantitativo, la estadística, la ciencia de datos y la docencia. Esta combinación le ha permitido abordar los datos no solamente desde la perspectiva matemática y computacional, sino también desde la comprensión de los fenómenos económicos, administrativos y sociales que les dan origen.\nCuenta con experiencia en el uso de ","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"eZJABOLuEC"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Python, R, SPSS, Excel avanzado y Power BI","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"rJzcb6pLp7"}],"key":"W7UWBDHIX5"},{"type":"text","value":", así como en herramientas orientadas al desarrollo y documentación de proyectos reproducibles, entre ellas ","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"vzl7pioJzK"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Jupyter, Quarto, LaTeX y GitHub","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"q3LGlTqCtO"}],"key":"w3F0AlxjMo"},{"type":"text","value":". Su trabajo reciente se ha concentrado especialmente en el análisis estadístico, la visualización de datos y la aplicación de técnicas de ","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"VS7X4NJPm7"},{"type":"emphasis","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Machine Learning","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"To1qJOwplI"}],"key":"JkJvT0aOUD"},{"type":"text","value":", incluyendo modelos de regresión y clasificación, métodos basados en árboles, técnicas de ensamble, redes neuronales y aprendizaje no supervisado.","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"Vs5I8OKuFM"}],"key":"Yr53UPYVdh"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Como docente, su interés se centra en acercar estos métodos a estudiantes y profesionales provenientes de distintas disciplinas. Su enfoque parte de una premisa fundamental: aprender análisis de datos no consiste únicamente en ejecutar código. Es necesario comprender el problema, conocer los datos, seleccionar adecuadamente los métodos, evaluar los resultados y, finalmente, ser capaz de interpretarlos.","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"R7J254RBEn"}],"key":"T7aUx52FI0"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"En los últimos años también ha incorporado a su trabajo académico el estudio y uso de la inteligencia artificial generativa, particularmente como herramienta para apoyar procesos de enseñanza, investigación, programación, análisis de información y construcción de recursos educativos.","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"dI7uDdxDiZ"}],"key":"TLr7T21qAl"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"La convergencia entre economía, administración pública, estadística e ingeniería de software define buena parte de su perfil profesional actual. Desde estas áreas busca integrar el razonamiento estadístico con las herramientas computacionales modernas para desarrollar soluciones aplicadas a problemas reales y, al mismo tiempo, facilitar su enseñanza.","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"key":"AQwBCzbRKP"}],"key":"j1g3gzoUbn"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":1},"end":{"line":22,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Su filosofía de trabajo puede resumirse en una idea que también orienta este curso: los datos adquieren verdadero valor cuando permiten comprender un problema, sustentar una decisión o generar nuevo conocimiento.","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":1},"end":{"line":22,"column":1}},"key":"UdehXU5agh"}],"key":"vozv8PJGcf"},{"type":"div","class":"redes-autor","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/zamora-thowinsson","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/red-linkedin-602484db3b062f4cdcef5e58be96f0ee.svg","key":"zYQUFPF7FQ","urlSource":"images/redes-images/red-linkedin.svg"},{"type":"text","value":" ","key":"qMoEchbJYo"}],"urlSource":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/zamora-thowinsson","key":"kF7JJtkK0n"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.youtube.com/@info.zamora","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/red-youtube-aef946e49086195c87e7d8e47cae2f29.svg","key":"aYRiJ0HdK3","urlSource":"images/redes-images/red-youtube.svg"},{"type":"text","value":" ","key":"jlioN8QjsI"}],"urlSource":"https://www.youtube.com/@info.zamora","key":"f8vMaMatIg"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.instagram.com/zamorathowinsson","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/red-instagram-1381a9a35995dff8e3392d1d731bde5f.svg","key":"CUzqDqXCbg","urlSource":"images/redes-images/red-instagram.svg"},{"type":"text","value":" ","key":"BcdmVVcJCr"}],"urlSource":"https://www.instagram.com/zamorathowinsson","key":"C5vpYzb0fI"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@msc..zamora.thowi","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/red-tiktok-98431b36b3263e5cd593ce7966364932.svg","key":"HJXyHtfhKg","urlSource":"images/redes-images/red-tiktok.svg"},{"type":"text","value":" ","key":"abMImGr0O0"}],"urlSource":"https://www.tiktok.com/@msc..zamora.thowi","key":"NEO1lY1dfI"},{"type":"link","url":"https://x.com/jthowinsson","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/red-x-60ebca7d2305856d20d71c2957ecd7b3.svg","key":"QLwDBsEfKQ","urlSource":"images/redes-images/red-x.svg"}],"urlSource":"https://x.com/jthowinsson","key":"RUZychjGJ